ctors held today resolved to continue the stock compensation plan which was introduced as a long-term incentive plan for members of the Board of Directors in 2016, as well as to continue the stock grant system which was introduced in 2014 as a global long-term incentive plan for Company Management in Japan. For details, please see [here](https://assets-dam.takeda.com/image/upload/v1778559894/Global/Investor/Financial-Results/FY2025/Q4/ENG_Press_Release_FY26_BIP_ESOP_Trust_Creation.pdf).</span></div></div></section></div></main><footer dir="ltr" class="Footer-module__FiyQGW__footerRedesign" data-optly-section="FooterRedesign"><div class="w-full max-w-[1400px] max-xl:max-w-[90vw] max-2xl:max-w-[1200px] mx-auto"><div class="Footer-module__FiyQGW__wrapperRedesign"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 justify-between"><a class="flex items-center justify-center min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px]" data-optly-part="logo" href="../../../../index.html"><span class="inline-block align-middle Footer-module__FiyQGW__logoRedesign" data-testid="root"><img draggable="false" alt="Takeda" loading="lazy" width="720" height="256" decoding="async" class="max-w-full h-auto rounded-none" src="../../../../assets/images/takeda-logo-light.svg" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:720 / 256"></span></a><ul class="flex items-center" role="list"><li class="flex ltr:mr-[24px] ltr:max-xs:mr-[16px] ltr:last:mr-0 rtl:ml-[24px] rtl:max-xs:ml-[16px] rtl:last:ml-0" role="listitem"><a class="group link Social-module__jLwnYq__root SocialRedesign-module__me7qtq__root" href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" __metadata="[object Object]" type="Social" data-optly-part="social-link" data-optly-key="1f14579e-7c12-4849-be12-a7d196bfb058"><div class="" data-testid="content"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" version="1.1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 22 21" class="Social-module__jLwnYq__icon SocialRedesign-module__me7qtq__icon" role="img" aria-hidden="false" __m